# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT – AI-POWERED CYBERSECURITY SUPER PLATFORM

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, modern, professional, scalable, AI-powered Cybersecurity Super Platform that combines three major products into one unified ecosystem:

1. AI Cybersecurity Academy – Learn all major cybersecurity disciplines through AI-powered education.
2. AI Cyber Lab – Practice cybersecurity through interactive tasks, virtual terminals, coding environments, simulations, and ready-made security tools.
3. Cybersecurity Marketplace – Allow companies to hire verified cybersecurity professionals, purchase security services, and access ready-made cybersecurity tools.

The platform must serve three main user groups:

- Students and cybersecurity learners.
- Cybersecurity professionals and ethical hackers.
- Companies, organizations, businesses, and enterprise customers.

The main objective is to create an ecosystem where people can learn cybersecurity, practice real-world skills in controlled environments, become certified professionals, and get hired by companies, while businesses can access professional cybersecurity services and security tools.

The platform must be designed as a premium global SaaS product, not just an ordinary educational website.

